  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Resilient Water Management through Groundwater Governance and Early Warning in Nepal (ICF CDEL).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To install and expand real-time groundwater monitoring stations and early warning systems in water-stressed areas. Strengthen the capacity of national, provincial, and local governments to use groundwater data for regulation, management, and preparedness.</narrative>
  </description>
